 "date": "2026-11-09T21:08:06+04:00",
 "subject": "Replace the car lineup with 29 picture cars from the car pack (standard ones only)",
 "body": "- tools/import_cars.py: removes painted checkerboard backgrounds, crops, shrinks\n  (69 MB of pictures -> 3.7 MB), finds wheel arches; hand-placed wheels in car_wheels.json\n- data.gd loads assets/cars/pack/cars.json; driving classes keep the old balance\n  (Dune Buggy = old Buggy, Snowplow keeps the x2.2 ice grip)\n- weight sits low at axle height, long noses slope up so blades don't dig in\n- new cartoon tires, glowing pads for hover cars, garage zooms out for big cars\n- old cars removed (Kenney kit assets deleted); owned ones are refunded as coins\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
